<report>
<title>Sample size for paired cohort study</title>

<p>Event rate in control group = @{pc:roundu}<br />
Event rate in experimental group = @{ps:roundu}<br />
Correlation for failure between experimental and control subjects = @{r:roundu}<br />
Alpha = @{alpha:roundu}<br />
Power = @{power:roundu}</p>

<p>Estimated minimum sample size = @size pairs</p>
<block name="assumptions">

<p>NB:Assumptions of this calculation may cause over estimation of sample size when power is low.  However, true power associated with @cases cases will be no less than @no_less and no greater than @no_greater.</p>
</block>
</report>
